BT /F4 12.00 Tf ET
q BT 65.20 771.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.997 Tw (Marco Bellini had cooked for Don Aurelio Costa for twenty years, and in all that time no one) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 750.98 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (who ate his food had ever died.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 721.50 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Until the Don's seventieth birthday.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 692.02 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.217 Tw (The dinner was in the Don's own house. Twelve guests. The family, the inner circle, the men) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 671.61 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.208 Tw (who mattered. Marco cooked for three days: the osso buco, the risotto, the tiramisu the Don's) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 651.20 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.424 Tw (late wife used to love. He tasted every dish himself before it left his kitchen, the way he always) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 630.79 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (did, because a chef who does not taste his own food is not a chef.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 601.31 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.278 Tw (At nine o'clock, the Don stood up. He raised his wine glass. He said, "To family," and he drank.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 580.90 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.295 Tw (And before the glass was back on the table, he was on the floor, clutching his chest, his face) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 560.49 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (turning grey.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 531.01 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.350 Tw (Poison, the doctor said. Fast. In the wine, or in the food. The police came. The family came.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 510.60 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.938 Tw (And everyone looked at the chef, because the chef controls the food, and the chef controls the) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 490.20 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (kitchen, and when a man dies at his own dinner table, the chef is always the first suspect.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 460.72 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.182 Tw (Marco did not run. He stood in his kitchen with his hands covered in flour and said the same) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 440.31 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (thing, over and over: "My food was clean. I tasted everything.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 410.83 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.118 Tw (Nobody believed him. Why would they? The Don's son, Roberto, had him locked in the wine) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 390.42 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.179 Tw (cellar overnight, and in the morning Roberto came down with two of his men and said, "Tell me) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 370.01 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (who did it, or you did it.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 340.53 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.747 Tw (Marco thought about that night, minute by minute, the way a chef thinks about a recipe. Every) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 320.12 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (dish. Every plate. Every hand that had touched anything.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 290.64 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (And then he remembered the glasses.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 261.16 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.621 Tw (There had been twelve glasses on the table, and only three people had touched them: Marco) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 240.75 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.717 Tw (himself, who set them out; Enzo the sommelier, who filled them; and Isabella Costa, the Don's) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 220.34 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (daughter-in-law, who poured the wine for her father-in-law's toast.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 190.86 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.675 Tw (Marco had watched her. She poured the Don's glass last, from a second bottle, a bottle she had) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 170.45 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.213 Tw (brought from the cellar herself. And she had smiled when she handed it to him. A small, strange) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 150.04 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (smile. The smile of a woman who has waited a very long time for a single moment.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 120.56 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 2.129 Tw (Marco knew that smile. He had seen it once before, a year ago, at the funeral of Isabella's) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 100.15 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.939 Tw (brother -- a young police detective who had been shot in an alley, in a killing nobody ever) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 79.74 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.998 Tw (solved. Isabella had stood by the coffin in the rain, and the Don had stood beside her, and the) Tj ET Q
