q BT 65.20 771.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.213 Tw (cards down from the shelf -- twenty years of them -- and he left one on the Don's table. On it, in) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 750.98 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (his own handwriting, were the words:) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 721.50 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.485 Tw ("The Chef's Last Recipe: one glass of wine. Serve to the man who deserves it. Never to anyone) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 701.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (else.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 671.61 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Then he took off his apron, folded it neatly, and walked out of the Costa house forever.) Tj ET Q
